# Copied to local/credentials.env at install. Never enters the repo; the agent cannot read local/.
# Fill in ONE of these so Claude Code stays signed in without a keyboard. See docs/login.md.
#
# Recommended: a long-lived subscription token. On this computer, signed in, run:  claude setup-token
# CLAUDE_CODE_OAUTH_TOKEN=
#
# Alternative: a Console API key (pay per use, never expires unless revoked). From console.anthropic.com:
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
